  "description": "Synthetic WhatsApp-style clothing orders (English + Hinglish) with the parse we expect. 'dev' cases were used while writing the rules; 'holdout' cases were written before the parser existed and were kept aside; one of them (h06) exposed a bug that was then fixed.",
