    "product is a category key: kurti, kurta_set, palazzo, legging, top, tshirt, night_suit, dupatta, saree, lehenga, gown, shrug, jacket, coord_set (shirt/jeans are valid parses but not stocked)",
    "colour is the canonical English colour, size is S/M/L/XL/XXL/XXXL, sarees and dupattas are FREE size",
    "a colour or size carries forward to the next line until the product changes; a 'Size M:' header applies to the whole list",
    "'2 each', '2-2' and 'ek ek' give that quantity to every listed size or colour",
    "due is a label: monday..sunday, today, tomorrow, day-after, this-week, next-week, diwali, date:N, or null"
  ],
